    "2–3 rest days a week is the recommended rhythm" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2–3 Ruhetage pro Woche sind der empfohlene Rhythmus"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2–3 rest days a week is the recommended rhythm"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2–3 días de descanso por semana es el ritmo recomendado"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2–3 jours de repos par semaine, c’est le rythme recommandé"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2–3 giorni di riposo a settimana sono il ritmo consigliato"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2–3 dias de descanso por semana é o ritmo recomendado"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2–3 дня отдыха в неделю — рекомендуемый ритм"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3–4 workouts a week is the sweet spot: strength grows while joints and tendons keep up. Muscle adapts in weeks, tendons in months — rest days protect the slower half." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3–4 Trainings pro Woche sind die goldene Mitte: Die Kraft wächst, und Gelenke und Sehnen kommen mit. Muskeln passen sich in Wochen an, Sehnen in Monaten – Ruhetage schützen die langsamere Hälfte."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3–4 workouts a week is the sweet spot: strength grows while joints and tendons keep up. Muscle adapts in weeks, tendons in months — rest days protect the slower half."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3–4 entrenamientos por semana es el punto justo: la fuerza crece y las articulaciones y los tendones le siguen el ritmo. El músculo se adapta en semanas, los tendones en meses — los días de descanso cuidan a la mitad lenta."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3–4 séances par semaine, c’est le juste milieu : la force progresse, et articulations et tendons suivent le rythme. Le muscle s’adapte en quelques semaines, les tendons en quelques mois — les jours de repos protègent la moitié la plus lente."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3–4 allenamenti a settimana sono il punto giusto: la forza cresce mentre articolazioni e tendini reggono il ritmo. I muscoli si adattano in settimane, i tendini in mesi – i giorni di riposo proteggono la metà più lenta."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3–4 treinos por semana é o ponto certo: a força cresce e as articulações e os tendões acompanham. O músculo se adapta em semanas, os tendões em meses — os dias de descanso protegem a metade lenta."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3–4 тренировки в неделю — золотая середина: сила растет, а суставы и сухожилия успевают за ней. Мышцы адаптируются за недели, сухожилия — за месяцы; дни отдыха берегут медленную половину."
          }
        }
      }
    },
